# What Semgrep skips (ADR 0043). This file replaces Semgrep's built-in list,
# which skips test/ and tests/: our tests are scanned too. Semgrep also skips
# whatever .gitignore ignores. check:workspace (G7) fails unless the entries
# below are exactly these four.

# Installed packages, not our code.
node_modules/
# Downloaded tool binaries (gitleaks), gitignored as well.
.tools/
# Deliberately bad workflows and compose files that prove the
# check:workspace guards (ADR 0031, ADR 0034).
scripts/guard-fixtures/
# The rules themselves and their known-bad self-test fixtures; the CI
# self-test scans the fixtures on purpose.
tooling/semgrep/
